# Screenshots of the main window on examples/ihp-inv: Libraries and Library Manager,
# a schematic in the embedded xschem, a layout in the embedded KLayout, the Hierarchy
# panel and the Inspector. Writes main-*.png, schematic.png, layout.png,
# hierarchy.png, inspector.png. Run: scripts/gen-doc-screenshots.sh docs/screenshots/main.script
window 1400 900
wait 0.5
screenshot @SHOTS@/main-window.png
panel Library Manager
wait 0.3
select cells inv schematic
wait 0.3
screenshot @SHOTS@/library-manager.png

open cells inv schematic
wait_frame
wait 0.5
screenshot @SHOTS@/schematic.png

open cells buf layout
wait_frame
layout_zoom fit
wait 1
screenshot @SHOTS@/layout.png

open cells buf schematic
wait_frame
panel Hierarchy
hierarchy_mode schematic files
expect_hierarchy inv ×2 (x1, x2)
wait 0.5
screenshot @SHOTS@/hierarchy.png

click_instance x1
wait 0.5
panel Inspector
wait 0.8
screenshot @SHOTS@/inspector.png
quit
